    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d266-a1">

                <pb facs="0318" n="1052" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1052"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 425.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Señor Larrabrue to Mr. Hicks.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>,<lb/><placeName><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1892-09-10"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                10, 1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your excellency’s esteemed note, 101, of the 2d instant, in which
                    the attention of this department is urged on behalf of the claim of the
                    Hydrographic Commission of the Amazon.</p>
                <p>As your excellency knows, these claims, which the Government considers just, will
                    have to he submitted to Congress.</p>
                <p>In reply, I am pleased to state to your excellency on the arrival of the time for
                    the presentation of the said list of mentioned claims, this department will take
                    care to include in the same the claim you mentioned in your referred note of the
                    2d instant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Larrabrue y Unanne.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
